{{Term/Store|Shard of Dinraal's Horn|Shards of Dinraal's Horn|Series, BotW|plural}} are [[Item]]s in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Shard of Dinraal's Horn}}<br/>This shard chipped and fell off the red spirit Dinraal. Its horn is said to be the crystallized power of fire itself. It sells for a high price, but rumors say there's some other use for it.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
Shards of Dinraal's Horn can be collected by shooting [[Dinraal]] in the horn as it flies by. The Shard will fly off the dragon and land on the ground nearby, surrounded by light.

[[Cooking]] with Shards of Dinraal's Horn results in a meal that has a buff lasting thirty minutes. They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to create Crimson [[Dye]].

A Shard of Dinraal's Horn must be collected as part of {{TCB}} [[Main Quest]] "[[EX Champion Revali's Song]]".<ref>{{Cite|♪One, {{Color BotW|Red|shoot the flame dragon's horn}}.|Kass|BotW}}</ref> When this quest is active, Dinraal will fly through [[Tanagar Canyon]] often during the night, which is noted by [[Mazli]].<ref>{{Cite|Come to think of it...the {{Color BotW|Blue|dragon}} always flies through this valley at night.|Mazli|BotW}}</ref> Mazli also notices that Dinraal's horns have been lighting up recently.<ref>{{Cite|When it does, its {{Color BotW|Red|horns light up}}. There's something about that light that's truly captivating.|Mazli|BotW}}</ref> Shooting Dinraal's horn will cause the [[Shira Gomar Shrine]] to rise up from out of the ground.

Shards of Dinraal's Horn are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Shard of Dinraal's Horn}}

